WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:03.390
Your bitcoin is only as safe as your keys.

2
00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:07.270
And most keys are kept on devices that are online.

3
00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:10.410
Online devices can be hacked.

4
00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:13.660
And hardware wallets cost money,

5
00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:15.450
and ship to your home address.

6
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.550
SafeKeepVault keeps your bitcoin keys offline, using a computer you already own.

7
00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.330
It's free, and open source.

8
00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.880
Here's how it works.

9
00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:29.970
First, copy it onto a USB flash drive.

10
00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.540
Next, start your computer from it.

11
00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:36.870
All networking and disk access are removed when it boots.

12
00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:42.140
Create seed words, passphrases, watch-only wallets,

13
00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:44.670
and review and sign bitcoin transactions.

14
00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:48.670
Everything happens using a full-size screen and keyboard.

15
00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:53.890
So you see exactly who gets paid, and how much, before you sign a transaction.

16
00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:58.070
Your wallet app stays online. Your keys never do.

17
00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:03.710
Payments pass between them by QR code or USB drive, and come back signed.

18
00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:05.470
It costs nothing.

19
00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:07.330
There's nothing to order.

20
00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.330
Create backups only you can restore.

21
00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:13.110
And every line of code is public.

22
00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:15.240
SafeKeepVault.

23
00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:18.050
Get it free at safekeepbitcoin.com.

